WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — satiation (ig) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:07.613
<v Narrator>N'oge mbụ, ọrụ ọbụla nwere ngwụcha laịnụ, nakwa ọrụ kọmputa ọzọ mgbe nke ahụ bụ ihe a ga-ahapụ.

2
00:00:07.693 --> 00:00:17.339
<v Narrator>Nke abụọ, ọnụ ala kọmputa ọrụ na-eme ka ndị mmadụ malite ọtụtụ ọrụ ọzọ, ya mere zuru ezu iji nwere ike ịnọgide na-arị elu.

3
00:00:17.419 --> 00:00:25.390
<v Narrator>Nke atọ, ọnụahịa ego maka AI na-abawanye ngwa ngwa, mana ike eletrik ọ na-ebugharị abụghị nke ọ bụla.
